	(text_box "TPS26600: I_LIM ≈ 12 A·kΩ / R_ILIM\n  → 7.5k ≈ 1.6 A (JST PH: 2 A per contact).\nt_dVdT = 8e3 · V_IN · C_dVdT\n  → 22 nF ≈ 4.2 ms at 24 V.\nIMON: 78 µA/A into 18k → 1.4 V/A\n  (2.2 V at the limit), for a future\n  supervisor's ADC.\nUVLO / OVP / MODE to GND: internal\n  15 V / 33 V thresholds, auto-retry."
